policy_v3_ci: v3 tables with cluster-bootstrap CIs (2000 resamples over load scenarios), Clopper-Pearson miss-rate bounds, seeds and sizes
tau=1.01 eps_v=0.001; policies calibrated with c from the checkpoint's own paper set (cross-set, evaluated on the stress sets) or 5-fold CV grouped by load scenario (paper set itself)
Base-case policies use c measured against our own converged NR ('own NR', the stronger baseline) and against datakit's labels ('datakit').
Bounds: cp_hi = Clopper-Pearson two-sided 95% upper limit, cp_hi1 = one-sided 95% upper limit; 'load' = fraction of LOAD SCENARIOS with >= 1 miss (cluster-level, no independence assumption).
Test splits: base seed 0: splits_paper_test; base seed 1: splits_paper_test_seed1; base seed 42: splits_paper_test_seed42; small seed 0: splits_paper_test; tiny seed 0: splits_paper_test; stress sets: data/stress/n{1,2,3,5} splits_all.
(paper sets of Base seed 1 / 42 are DIFFERENT test sets from seed 0: those checkpoints were trained on other splits; stress sets are identical for all checkpoints)

[base seed 0] sets: paper N-1 (638 scen, 29 load scen), stress N-1 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-2 (659 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-3 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-5 (660 scen, 30 load scen)
[base seed 1] sets: paper N-1 (814 scen, 37 load scen), stress N-1 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-2 (659 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-3 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-5 (660 scen, 30 load scen)
[base seed 42] sets: paper N-1 (616 scen, 28 load scen), stress N-1 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-2 (659 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-3 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-5 (660 scen, 30 load scen)
[small seed 0] sets: paper N-1 (638 scen, 29 load scen), stress N-1 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-2 (659 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-3 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-5 (660 scen, 30 load scen)
[tiny seed 0] sets: paper N-1 (638 scen, 29 load scen), stress N-1 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-2 (659 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-3 (660 scen, 30 load scen), stress N-5 (660 scen, 30 load scen)

